=== M13 complete ===
The exact Adler curve R_cross(dw) = δ - sqrt(δ²-1) reproduces the
spread of disputed γ values without requiring any 'material' exponent.
Local slopes over different windows yield γ from ~0.6 to ~2.5 --
precisely the range THM-002 documented.
